\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Christ is made the sure foundation,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Christ the head and corner-stone,
\par Chosen of the Lord, and precious,
\par Binding all the Church in one,
\par The helper of Holy Zion
\par And her confidence alone.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  To this temple, where we call Thee,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Come, O Lord of hosts, to-day:
\par With thy servants loving-kindness,
\par Hear Thy servants as they pray,
\par And Thy fullest benediction
\par Shed within its walls always.
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Hear vouchsafe to all Thy servants
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 What they ask of Thee to gain,
\par What they from Thee for ever get
\par With the blessed to retain,
\par And hereafter in Thy glory
\par Evermore with Thee to reign.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Laud and honour to the Father,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Laud and honour to the Son,
\par Laud and honour to the Spirit,
\par Ever Three and ever One,
\par One in might, and one in glory,'
\par \pard      While unending ages run.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

